abstract:
  PDF Snapshot Archive API is a REDCap External Module that extends
  the REDCap API to reach the PDF Snapshot Archive folder of the
  File Repository. It adds get-items and get-file actions so API
  users can read the attributes of archived PDF snapshots and
  download the files.
